Adobe Premiere Pro Auto-Save/
Adobe After Effects Auto-Save/
*.pek            # Premiere audio peak cache
*.cfa            # Premiere conformed audio
*.prtl           # Premiere title (legacy)
Media Cache/
Media Cache Files/
*.aep.lock
CamDiagnostics/

# Lightroom helper files (keep catalog, drop volatile bits)
*.lrcat-journal
*.lrcat.lock
*.lrdata/        # large render cache; re-buildable

# Capture One cache
*.cocache/
*.cosessiondb-journal

# DaVinci Resolve cache
CacheClip/
ProxyMedia/

# ---- Proxy / preview renders (re-buildable) ----
Proxies/
Previews/

